Ownership: DocumentationPurpose:  Defines documentation ownership rules and routing.OwnerRoles:  DEVELOPER:    docs/developer/*    docs/architecture/*  QA:    docs/testing/*  SECURITY:    docs/security/*  DEVOPS:    docs/infrastructure/*    docs/deployment/*    docs/operations/*  SUPPORT:    docs/support/*  BUSINESS:    docs/business/*  ARCHITECT:    docs/architecture/*    docs/decisions/*OwnershipRules:  [DOC1]  Every document MUST have exactly one PRIMARY owner.  [DOC2]  Document owner is responsible for keeping it CURRENT.  [DOC3]  When code changes, the relevant document owner MUST verify          the doc is still accurate.  [DOC4]  Stale documentation MUST be flagged by the agent during          code review.  [DOC5]  Documentation lint checks MUST run as part of quality gates.Routing:  DB latency:    PRIMARY: DEVOPS    SECONDARY: BACKEND  Broken UI:    PRIMARY: FRONTEND    SECONDARY: QA  Payment security issue:    PRIMARY: SECURITY    SECONDARY: BACKEND, QAState: +  
